QSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"gm5Y2Q_-MzsnjytoG1Oo2w","review_id":"zMGSRiZG-O92um4-lriiZg","date":"2011-03-28T05:44:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9376864433288574,"text_excerpt":"Do you like late night coffee, local indie musicians, eclectic local art, dimly lit rooms with random couches? If so, then you'll probably love this cozy little coffee house. I don't know what took me so long to find my way to this place. I can't say that the coffee was anything special. However, it is clear to me that people are here for the music events rather than the coffee. That said, even without the music, I would still come here for the atmosphere. This coffee shop would be great for sitting around with friends and playing games or working on some school work. The open mic night is a lot of fun. I could tell that the people participating seemed to be really comfortable with each o..."},{"business_id":"gm5Y2Q_-MzsnjytoG1Oo2w","review_id":"l2tWobreXeu8XvPH8YNoFg","date":"2009-03-29T02:20:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9143009185791016,"text_excerpt":"Neutral Ground is an old school type coffee shop (anybody else remember Barsodi's?). It is more about the atmosphere and the camaraderie. I just walked past and they had 3 different people playing tonight, plus poetry, plus books, plus games, plus coffee & tea."},{"business_id":"gm5Y2Q_-MzsnjytoG1Oo2w","review_id":"eide0fqZGTpgw9WD2GoVlQ","date":"2011-07-07T01:54:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9118943214416504,"text_excerpt":"This is a nice place for local musicians, coffee, and a ridiculously eclectic assortment of couches/chairs. The service is friendly, the place is clean, and they're more than welcoming to amateur musicians/poets/other artists. This is a good place to relax, listen to some local music, and have some coffee/tea."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gm5Y2Q_-MzsnjytoG1Oo2w","photo_id":"ysZFVFKyGDi_IkMR8IxysA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ysZFVFKyGDi_IkMR8IxysA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9473450779914856},{"business_id":"gm5Y2Q_-MzsnjytoG1Oo2w","photo_id":"rzf_tVN2ddEMhnXTLRcOWQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rzf_tVN2ddEMhnXTLRcOWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9473450183868408}]},"notebook_case":null}
